ينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِرَبِّهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُشْرِكُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/e746ea776deac7edf9ab.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "(ne) pripisuju druga", "en": "they (do not) associate partners", "tr": "ortak koşmazlar", "fr": "ils (n')associent (pas)", "id": "mereka (tidak) mempersekutukan", "ur": "وہ شرک (نہیں) کرتے", "bn": "তারা শরীক করে (না)", "fa": "شرک می‌ورزند (نه)"}}]}, {"ref": "6:22", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/811.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And on the day We gather them together We shall say unto those who ascribed partners (unto Allah): Where are (now) those partners of your make-believe?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O gün hepsini mahşere toplayacağız. Sonra Allah'a ortak koşanlara: \" Hani nerede o Allah'a ortak saydığınız ortaklarınız?\" diyeceğiz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور جس دن ہم سب کو اٹھائیں گے پھر مشرکوں سے فرمائیں گے کہاں ہیں تمہارے وہ شریک جن کا تم دعویٰ کرتے تھے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan (ingatlah), hari yang di waktu itu Kami menghimpun mereka semuanya kemudian Kami berkata kepada orang-orang musyrik: \"Di manakah sembahan-sembahan kamu yang dulu kamu katakan (sekutu-sekutu) Kami?\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَيَوْمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَحْشُرُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَمِيعًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَقُولُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَشْرَكُوٓا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a1eda8d3f2c662c02b46.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "(oni koji su) pripisivali druga", "en": "(those who) associated partners", "tr": "(ortak) koşanlar", "fr": "(ceux qui) ont donné des associés", "id": "(orang-orang yang) mempersekutukan", "ur": "(جنہوں نے) شرک کیا", "bn": "(যারা) শরীক করেছে", "fa": "(کسانی که) شرک ورزیدند"}}, {"text": "أَيْنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شُرَكَآؤُكُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَزْعُمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "40:73", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4206.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Then it is said unto them: Where are (all) that ye used to make partners (in the Sovereignty)", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sonra da onlara: \"Nerede o ortak koştuklarınız?\" denilecek.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "پھر ان سے فرمایا جائے گا کہاں گئے وہ جو تم شریک بناتے تھے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "kemudian dikatakan kepada mereka: \"Manakah berhala-berhala yang selalu kamu persekutukan,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ثُمَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قِيلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَيْنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُشْرِكُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "